@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Login (credentials come from user-secrets: Seed:AdminUserName / Seed:AdminPassword)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "admin", "password": "" }

### Groups visible to the current user
GET {{host}}/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Roll call for a group and date
GET {{host}}/api/groups/1/rollcall?date=2026-10-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report summary
GET {{host}}/api/reports/summary?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
